### Day 9/50 — Keys

In a database,
a key helps identify something.

Among thousands of records,
it tells you:

*This one is different.*

A **primary key** makes sure
no two records are exactly the same.

And maybe that's kind of beautiful.

In a world full of people
who might have the same name,
the same interests,
or even similar stories...
there is still something
that makes each of us uniquely ourselves.

**Maybe we are all just records in a very large database,
each carrying a key no one else has.**
